n of the new security system  at ua means that the security system is  likely going to be tested by the  villains at some point in the future  chances are that the villains will  attack the ua at some point and that is  where the final showdown of the entire  series could take place and if that is  the ultimate plan for the story then  having toga infiltrating the ua makes  perfect sense especially since she did  so little during the entire massive  jakku incident i was honestly surprised  by how small of a role toga played in  jakku but if her plan was not to draw  attention to herself so that she could  infiltrate the ua later then that would  make perfect sense at any rate here are  the major developments that we got in  this chapter as i see them first we have  the confirmation that deku now knows  that he has to work together with others  and second we have those anti-deku  protesters finally appearing to accept  his presence at ua then we have the  brief references to obero and toga some  might think that these mentions were  very brief and therefore unimportant but  i believe that they are actually  foreshadowing for future events i think  that obero really could regain  consciousness once again maybe even  permanently and i believe that toga will  become relevant in the story very soon  my guess is that she has already  infiltrated the ua and that her role is  to set the stage for the final showdown  of the series which will take place at  the ua itself but let me know what you  guys think did you enjoy the emotional  elements of this chapter and do you  think that the mentioning of toga and  obero were important foreshadowing or  just passing references finally why was  endeavour wearing a fedora i need to  know if you guys enjoyed this video and  you want to see more in the future do me  a favor and leave a quick like it only  takes a second but it helps a lot and if  you're new to anime uproar or maybe you  watch our videos but you still haven't  taken the time to subscribe yet make  this the video that you subscribe and  hit that notification bell to turn on  all notifications you can also hit me up  on twitter and instagram at animeopror  thanks again to dislight for sponsoring  this video check them out link in the  description as always thank you guys so  much for watching and until next time  see ya space cowboys  [Music]  you
 

